    <data key="d1">[{"content": "AlgoFactory 合成回归扩展示例\n本材料是项目自编的公开演示，不含真实业务数据。任务为有监督表格回归：x1、x2、x3 是数值特征，value 是连续目标，row_id 和目标不得作为特征。输出连续预测值，不提供分类概率。训练、验证、测试按固定种子独立划分，预处理只在训练集拟合。\n回归能力使用 Ridge Regression：SimpleImputer(strategy=median)、StandardScaler、Ridge(alpha=1.0) 放入 Pipeline，通过 ColumnTransformer 选择数值列。依赖为 scikit-learn。指标是 MAE 和 RMSE，越低越好；冻结门槛由主机协议提供，不使用测试集调参。生成代码仅在禁网、非 root Docker 中执行，120 秒、2 CPU、4096 MiB。\n", "id": "source:b07ff4609755bb9dc34b0e3dfd8d088c0fd579f5b4f8e0900e9f989af6a3a59f", "schema_version": 1, "sha256": "b07ff4609755bb9dc34b0e3dfd8d088c0fd579f5b4f8e0900e9f989af6a3a59f", "title": "synthetic_regression.txt"}, {"content": "{\"candidate\":{\"attempt\":0,\"code_hash\":\"89f8e5686986c46bd0f0d329019f9829537644c0ed8e93fbfc0184d5948bfebc\",\"implementation_id\":\"workflow:b7e98ed8b155419d88d30f62ba6e6d5a:candidate\",\"parent_id\":null,\"plan_id\":\"workflow:b7e98ed8b155419d88d30f62ba6e6d5a:plan\",\"schema_version\":1},\"code_hash\":\"89f8e5686986c46bd0f0d329019f9829537644c0ed8e93fbfc0184d5948bfebc\",\"evaluation_scope\":\"validation_and_final_test\",\"execution_evidence\":[\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase5-verification-delivery/regression/validation-execution/execution.json\",\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase5-verification-delivery/regression/test-execution/execution.json\"],\"experience_usage\":{\"enabled\":false,\"excluded\":[],\"interpretation\":\"Delivery and model-declared use are traceable; causality requires controlled comparison.\",\"matches\":[],\"model_decisions\":[],\"observed_rule_satisfied\":false},\"plan\":{\"algorithm_id\":\"source:b07ff4609755bb9dc34b0e3dfd8d088c0fd579f5b4f8e0900e9f989af6a3a59f:algorithm:logistic_regression\",\"dependencies\":[\"scikit-learn\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"source:b07ff4609755bb9dc34b0e3dfd8d088c0fd579f5b4f8e0900e9f989af6a3a59f:algorithm:logistic_regression\",\"source:b07ff4609755bb9dc34b0e3dfd8d088c0fd579f5b4f8e0900e9f989af6a3a59f:capability:regression\"],\"pla